{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef0102030405",
    "name": "AGORA — Integration Cart & Checkout",
    "description": "Carrito de integración (`/integrations/cart`) y flujo web: enlace firmado `t`, sesión pública e import al carrito de usuario.\n\n**Bases**\n- Integración: `{{baseUrl}}` **sin** `/api` (ej. `https://api.agoramp.mx` o `http://localhost:3000`).\n- Carrito usuario / import: `{{baseUrl}}/api/...`\n\n**Auth del webhook** (elige una)\n- `X-Webhook-Secret: {{webhookSecret}}`\n- `Authorization: Bearer {{webhookSecret}}`\n\n**Variables de colección**\n`webhookSecret`, `storeId` (core.stores), `cartId`, `productId`, `branchId`, `itemId`, `linkToken` (query `t`), `accessToken` (JWT Supabase).\n\n**Enlaces**\n- Con `storeId` en el body del POST `.../link` se genera URL contextual (ej. `/sucursal/{slug}/cart?t=`).\n- Con `path` explícito se ignora la derivación por tienda.\n\n**Documentación:** `docs/integrations/integration-cart-api.md`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "webhookSecret", "value": "" },
    { "key": "storeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cartId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "branchId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" },
    { "key": "itemId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "customerPhone", "value": "5217717875215" },
    { "key": "linkToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Carrito",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Crear carrito",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unwrap = (r) => (r && r.data !== undefined ? r.data : r);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = unwrap(pm.response.json());",
                  "  if (j && j.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cartId', j.id);",
                  "    console.log('cartId →', j.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"storeId\": \"{{storeId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Crea `orders.integration_carts` para `core.stores`. 201 devuelve `id` (UUID del carrito).",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Carrito con ítems",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "description": "410 si el carrito expiró.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Carrito completo",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Ítems",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Agregar ítem",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unwrap = (r) => (r && r.data !== undefined ? r.data : r);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = unwrap(pm.response.json());",
                  "  const items = j && j.items;",
                  "  if (items && items.length) {",
                  "    const last = items[items.length - 1];",
                  "    if (last.id) {",
                  "      pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', last.id);",
                  "      console.log('itemId →', last.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"branchId\": \"{{branchId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "`branchId` obligatorio (reglas según `store.type`). Línea duplicada suma cantidad.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Agregar ítem (variantes + notas)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unwrap = (r) => (r && r.data !== undefined ? r.data : r);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = unwrap(pm.response.json());",
                  "  const items = j && j.items;",
                  "  if (items && items.length) {",
                  "    const last = items[items.length - 1];",
                  "    if (last.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', last.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"branchId\": \"{{branchId}}\",\n  \"variantSelections\": {},\n  \"specialInstructions\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Ajusta `variantSelections` a UUIDs reales del catálogo si aplica.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Ítem (cantidad absoluta)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items/{{itemId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Ítem (delta)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantityDelta\": -1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items/{{itemId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Ítem",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items/{{itemId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Enlaces (sitio / WhatsApp)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Generar enlace (storeId → /sucursal/.../cart)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unwrap = (r) => (r && r.data !== undefined ? r.data : r);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = unwrap(pm.response.json());",
                  "  if (j && j.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('linkToken', j.token);",
                  "    console.log('linkToken guardado');",
                  "    console.log('url →', j.url);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ttlSeconds\": 604800,\n  \"storeId\": \"{{storeId}}\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{customerPhone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Requiere `FRONTEND_URL` en el backend. `storeId` debe ser el mismo que el del carrito. Respuesta: `url`, `token`, `store_id`, `path`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/link"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Generar enlace (path manual)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unwrap = (r) => (r && r.data !== undefined ? r.data : r);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = unwrap(pm.response.json());",
                  "  if (j && j.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('linkToken', j.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ttlSeconds\": 604800,\n  \"path\": \"/carrito/integracion\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{customerPhone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "`path` tiene prioridad sobre la ruta derivada por `storeId`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/link"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Generar enlace (query)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unwrap = (r) => (r && r.data !== undefined ? r.data : r);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = unwrap(pm.response.json());",
                  "  if (j && j.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('linkToken', j.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "description": "Parámetros opcionales: `ttlSeconds`, `path`, `storeId`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/link?ttlSeconds=604800&storeId={{storeId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Session por token t (sin webhook)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "description": "Público. Usa `linkToken` guardado o pega el `t` completo.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/session?t={{linkToken}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Checkout web (JWT)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Importar a carrito de usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{linkToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Mismo token `t` del enlace. Sustituye el carrito del usuario por el de integración.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/cart/import-integration"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Auth alternativa (Bearer)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Crear carrito (Bearer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const unwrap = (r) => (r && r.data !== undefined ? r.data : r);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = unwrap(pm.response.json());",
                  "  if (j && j.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('cartId', j.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"storeId\": \"{{storeId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Misma clave que el webhook, en `Authorization: Bearer`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
